Extra Special >> Spy Girl Runtime Controls
------------------------------------------

ESC / mouse button : exit
X                  : enable demo mode
V                  : toggle debug text on/off after demo mode is enabled
T                  : show/hide tunnel effect, only after demo mode is enabled
C                  : toggle camera mode FREE / LOOK_AT after demo mode is enabled
O / P              : decrease / increase Maggie ticks per frame after demo mode is enabled
SPACEBAR           : pause/unpause the Maggie animation stream after demo mode is enabled

LOOK_AT camera mode:
A/D                : orbit around the model horizontally
Q/E                : orbit around the model vertically
W/S                : move closer/farther from the model

FREE camera mode:
A/D                : move camera on X
Q/E                : move camera on Y
W/S                : move camera on Z
Left/Right         : rotate camera yaw
Up/Down            : rotate camera pitch


